## Parsea un `for` de rango o de colección.
##
## ## Memoria
## Crea `for_range_stmt` o `for_in_stmt`.
weave pstmt_parse_for with p as ref to PsParser into int:
    var start as int is calling ps_current_start with p
    var ignored as Token is calling ps_expect_kw with p, KwFor, "'for'"
    calling ps_begin_children with p
    calling pstmt_add_name with p, "loop variable"
    var name1 as int is 0
    if calling ps_check_kw with p, KwFrom:
        var ignored2 as Token is calling ps_advance with p
        var from as int is calling pexpr.pexpr_parse_expr_no_cast with p
        calling ps_add_child with p, from
        var ignored3 as Token is calling ps_expect_kw with p, KwTo, "'to'"
        var to as int is calling pexpr.pexpr_parse_expr_no_cast with p
        calling ps_add_child with p, to
        if calling ps_check_kw with p, KwStep:
            var ignored4 as Token is calling ps_advance with p
            var step as int is calling pexpr.pexpr_parse_expr_no_cast with p
            calling ps_add_child with p, step
        else:
            calling ps_add_absent with p
        var block as int is calling pstmt_parse_block with p
        calling ps_add_child with p, block
        return calling ps_finish_node with p, NodeKind.NdForRangeStmt, start, (calling pexpr.pexpr_end_of with p, block), 0
    if calling ps_check with p, TokComma:
        var ignored5 as Token is calling ps_advance with p
        if calling ps_check with p, TokIdentifier:
            calling ps_add_token with p, p->pos
            var ignored6 as Token is calling ps_advance with p
        else:
            calling ps_emit_here with p, pdiag.ParseIssue.ParseExpectedName, ""
    var ignored7 as Token is calling ps_expect_kw with p, KwIn, "'in'"
    var iterable as int is calling pexpr.pexpr_parse_expr with p
    calling ps_add_child with p, iterable
    var block2 as int is calling pstmt_parse_block with p
    calling ps_add_child with p, block2
    return calling ps_finish_node with p, NodeKind.NdForInStmt, start, (calling pexpr.pexpr_end_of with p, block2), 0

## Parsea un `when` statement y su `else`.
##
