## Crea `when_stmt` y `when_else_plain`/`when_else_when`.
weave pstmt_parse_when_stmt with p as ref to PsParser into int:
    var start as int is calling ps_current_start with p
    var ignored as Token is calling ps_expect_kw with p, KwWhen, "'when'"
    var cond as int is calling pexpr.pexpr_parse_expr with p
    var blk as int is calling pstmt_parse_block with p
    calling ps_begin_children with p
    calling ps_add_child with p, cond
    calling ps_add_child with p, blk
    if calling ps_check_kw with p, KwElse:
        var eb as int is calling pstmt_parse_when_else with p
        calling ps_add_child with p, eb
    else:
        calling ps_add_absent with p
    return calling ps_finish_node with p, NodeKind.NdWhenStmt, start, (calling ps_previous_end with p), 0

## Parsea el `else` de un `when` statement.
##
## ## Memoria
## Crea `when_else_plain` o `when_else_when`.
weave pstmt_parse_when_else with p as ref to PsParser into int:
    var start as int is calling ps_current_start with p
    var ignored as Token is calling ps_expect_kw with p, KwElse, "'else'"
    if calling ps_check_kw with p, KwWhen:
        calling ps_begin_children with p
        var nested as int is calling pstmt_parse_when_stmt with p
        calling ps_add_child with p, nested
        return calling ps_finish_node with p, NodeKind.NdWhenElseWhen, start, (calling pexpr.pexpr_end_of with p, nested), 0
    var ignored2 as Token is calling ps_expect with p, TokColon, "':'"
    calling ps_begin_children with p
    if calling ps_check with p, TokNewline:
        var ignored3 as Token is calling ps_advance with p
        var ignored4 as Token is calling ps_expect with p, TokIndent, "indent"
        var more as bool is true
        while more:
            calling ps_skip_newlines with p
            if (calling ps_check with p, TokDedent) or (calling ps_check with p, TokEof):
                set more is false
            else:
                var before as int is p->pos
                var st as int is calling pstmt_parse_stmt with p
                calling ps_add_child with p, st
                calling pstmt_check_multiple with p
                if p->pos == before:
                    var forced as Token is calling ps_advance with p
        if calling ps_check with p, TokDedent:
            var ignored5 as Token is calling ps_advance with p
        else:
            calling ps_emit_here with p, pdiag.ParseIssue.ParseExpectedDedent, ""
    else:
        var simple as int is calling pstmt_parse_simple_stmt with p
        calling ps_add_child with p, simple
        calling ps_finish_statement with p
    return calling ps_finish_node with p, NodeKind.NdWhenElsePlain, start, (calling ps_previous_end with p), 0

## Parsea `with target:` como statement.
