    calling ps_begin_children with p
    calling ps_add_child with p, block
    return calling ps_finish_node with p, NodeKind.NdUnsafeStmt, start, (calling pexpr.pexpr_end_of with p, block), 0

## Parsea `defer`/`errdefer`.
##
## ## Memoria
## Crea `defer_stmt`/`errdefer_stmt`.
weave pstmt_parse_defer with p as ref to PsParser, kind as NodeKind into int:
    var start as int is calling ps_current_start with p
    if kind == NodeKind.NdDeferStmt:
        var ignored as Token is calling ps_expect_kw with p, KwDefer, "'defer'"
    else:
        var ignored2 as Token is calling ps_expect_kw with p, KwErrdefer, "'errdefer'"
    calling ps_begin_children with p
    if calling ps_check with p, TokColon:
        var block as int is calling pstmt_parse_block with p
        calling ps_add_child with p, block
    else:
        var expr as int is calling pexpr.pexpr_parse_expr with p
        calling ps_add_child with p, expr
        calling ps_finish_statement with p
    return calling ps_finish_node with p, kind, start, (calling ps_previous_end with p), 0

## Parsea `banish expr`.
